Write a recursive function to set the value for each node in a binary tree to be its depth then return the modified tree. 
You are given the following assumptions:
1. That nodes store integer values. 
2. On the initial call to BTsetdepth, depth is 0.
3. A list of methods that you can use on the BinNode objects:

interface BinNode {
public int value();
public void setValue(int v);
public BinNode left();
public BinNode right();
public boolean isLeaf();}

